## TODO: rename-identifier

After `drop-electron-compat` is done, rename the Tauri app identifier:

### tauri.conf.json
- Change `identifier` from `io.github.shulhaoleh.pd3modmanager` to `io.github.modrexio.modrex`

### NSIS hook (required for seamless upgrade)
- Add `bundle.windows.nsis.installerHooks` pointing to a custom NSIS script
- The script must read `HKCU\Software\Microsoft\Windows\CurrentVersion\Uninstall\io.github.shulhaoleh.pd3modmanager`
  and run the old uninstaller silently if found, so users on the old identifier get a clean upgrade
